<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99977" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεκ-πονέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>help in working out</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ θανόντι χάριτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1378
				</span></i>
			; <i>help in achieving</i> or <i>effecting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυγάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>IT</u>
					1063
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1406
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> without acc.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τινί</span>
			<i>join in labour with, assist to the utmost</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ion</u>
				850
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				136
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεκπονοῦσα κῶλον</span> perh.
				<i>sharing the</i> leg-<i>work</i>, i.e. helping me to walk,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ion</u>
				740
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
